    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Spelling in German",
     "texto": [
      "The verb **buchstabieren** means to spell.",
      "To ask politely: **Wie buchstabiert man das?** (how do you spell that?).",
      "Letters with special names:",
      "**J** is called «iot», **V** is called «fau», **W** is called «ve», **Z** is called «tset».",
      "**Ä** is called «a-Umlaut», **Ö** «o-Umlaut», **Ü** «u-Umlaut» and **ß** is called «Eszett» or «scharfes S»."
     ],
